<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brylane rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brylane rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Maura Hunter Byrne initiated coverage of Brylane Inc with a buy, setting a 12-month price target of $35 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/4 at 22-3/4.</p>
</text>
